{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_01",
  "title": "燈下黑",
  "storyCode": "GA-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6b2c5f698f7ed83e9f2976ac4f93c441851f03c898d91400b758d5d304e2bfb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g7_laterano_ward"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你現在已經可以離開輪椅行動了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，復健得還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去年這裡辦了個輪椅競速射擊賽，我拿了冠軍哦......然後就被醫生禁賽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要說能在射擊技巧上比過你的人，恐怕要去銃騎裡才能找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，這話我愛聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是某個人也能學學可愛的菲亞梅塔，對我這個病人說幾句好聽的話，我就更開心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提馬，你又打算站在那裡裝窗簾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我不是那樣的性格，蕾繆安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼樣的性格？你兩三年才回來一次，我記性不太好呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，蕾繆安的射擊技巧，是我所知道的人裡最出色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，這就對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小樂在龍門過得好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前段時間見過她一次，她過得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與其替她操心，不如替你自己操心比較好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這句話呢，我也原封不動地還給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這次回來會待多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道欸。不過，至少會待到會議結束，我記得是下下周三？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "周二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，周二。其他就看那個老傢伙的心情吧，誰知道會不會又給我派奇奇怪怪的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是把教宗閣下叫成了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他本人都不會介意啦，菲亞梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們要是想多留一陣子，我也可以幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經猜到了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？你們在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的沒發現嗎，菲亞梅塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近半年，我和你的報告交到了誰手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有那麼明顯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什麼？......所以，蕾繆安你......開始在教皇廳工作了？可是你還在復健......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，菲亞梅塔，只是一些文書工作而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會順著這條路走下去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還會回戍衛隊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那大概是回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的射擊技術，就這樣埋沒......太浪費了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亞梅塔對我的評價真高啊，明明那時我搞砸了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是你的責任，蕾繆安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也不是你的責任啊，菲亞梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別把自己繃得太緊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......總有一天，我要找他算清這筆帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎，莫斯提馬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能不能摸一摸你的角？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蕾繆安望向窗外，莫斯提馬靠在窗邊，玩弄手中的花朵。\n菲亞梅塔恍然回到當年。\n拉特蘭的早春，陽光總是明媚，空氣中帶著一絲寒意。\n透過窗戶，望見遠處大小教堂的屋頂。偶有羽獸劃過天際。\n蕾繆安平時很安靜，偶爾說出一兩句話，空氣都變得柔和。\n裝酷的莫斯提馬不自覺地放鬆，露出自己未能察覺的笑容。\n......\n一如既往。\n彷彿一切未曾發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而這只是錯覺。\n她為此夜不能寐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g7_laterano_ward"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆安......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在思考一件事情，蕾繆安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這家醫院的志願者很多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？一般吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆安小姐，我想給你看一份......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，有客人在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，她們都是我過去的戰友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰友......難道說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_353_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，或許三位都可以看一看這份檢查結果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧倫，你知道自己在做什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許可以請你告訴我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不會認為你的做法是“個人行為”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她會認為我們是在刻意展現“拉特蘭的姿態”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一不小心，這就會演變成外交問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這難道不正是你期待的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "衝突引發問題，問題需要解決，解決需要途徑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭在提供新的問題解決方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭能夠提供這種方式，有兩個前提條件——我們說的話有足夠分量，我們說的話足夠“合適”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯，拉特蘭需要有“合適的姿態”。如果拉特蘭也只是以自然博弈的結果為指向，那又何需拉特蘭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——您說對吧，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薇爾，你覺得他說的對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在假裝有腦子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭能立於大地，萬國信使能通行於諸國，歸根到底，因為拉特蘭擁有信仰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，萬國信使能通行於諸國，在於拉特蘭本身，敬愛的樞機大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都很明白，真正的拉特蘭信仰，無法及於薩科塔之外。想倚仗信仰做事，恐怕指望不上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧倫，你要是想死，可以直接提申請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我一直不明白，你們倆為什麼總能吵起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從維多利亞啟程返回拉特蘭時，高多汀公爵問了我一個問題，我相信這不是一個我能夠回答的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他問：“拉特蘭有什麼足以吸引我的地方？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下，坐上牌桌的時候，我們手裡的牌足夠多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
