    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那麼，請告訴我她的父母姓名、家庭住址、身份識別碼，以及你和她的血緣或法理關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
