    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戍衛隊也在找這個女孩嗎？你們從哪裡得到的消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
